codex
The sandbox hides `/proc/<pid>/exe`, which Lean 4.22 uses to locate its own installation. I’m applying a narrow local shim that only supplies the already-pinned executable path for that blocked lookup; all project inputs and Lean/Lake binaries remain unchanged, and the workaround source and hash will be retained as evidence.
apply patch
